  </p>

  <p>
    Email:
    <a href="mailto:info@dhanikbharat.org">info@dhanikbharat.org</a>
  </p>

  <div class="office-grid">

    <div>
      <h3>Registered Office</h3>

      <p>
        Unit No. 3A, Wing B, 2nd Floor,
        Times Square, Marol, Andheri (East),
        Mumbai – 400059.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h3>Corporate Office</h3>

      <p>
        Sai Plaza, MIG 366, 4th Floor,
        KPHB Colony, Kukatpally,
        Hyderabad, Telangana – 500072.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>

</section>

<footer>
  © 2027 Dhanik Bharat Educational Institutions.
  All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</main>

</body>
</html>
